***conformance tests***

# list-all-patients
After a reset, `GET /api/patients` answers 200 with `today` "2026-11-21", ten patients, `counters.total` 10, and `needsAttention` + `noData` + `stable` equal to 10.

# sorted-by-urgency
After a reset, the patients of `GET /api/patients` are in order of status red, yellow, no_data, insufficient_data, stable.
